# remote FRAS Map
remote/attach.go [Edge]: F:Single SSH connection handler and daemon version lifecycle manager | A:runAttach | S:See Security invariants item 5
remote/daemon.go [Core]: F:Host-side detached background daemon and socket listener | A:startDaemon | S:See Security invariants item 5
remote/frame.go [Infra]: F:Frame serialization and deserialization for host-gateway protocol | A:Header,encodeFrame,readFrame | S:Length-prefixed binary frame serialization with header and body bounds [T:TestFrameRoundTrip]
remote/legacy.go [Infra]: F:Talkcode backward compatibility shims and environment mappings | A:getenv,legacyTwin,withLegacyNames | S:Falls back to legacy TALKCODE_* environment variables [T:TestLegacyEnvIsReadWhenTheNewOneIsUnset]
remote/link.go [Core]: F:Sequenced reliable link mirroring TypeScript ReliableLink | A:newLink | S:Replays unacknowledged frames on reconnect [T:TestLinkResendsOnlyWhatThePeerMissed]
remote/main.go [Edge]: F:CLI entrypoint dispatching attach, daemon, shim, and dumpenv | A:main
remote/ops.go [Core]: F:Host filesystem and command operations | A:handleRPC
remote/paths.go [Infra]: F:Host directory layout and path helpers | A:binDirFor,expandHome,rootDir
remote/proc.go [Core]: F:Host agent process manager with Pdeathsig process lifecycle | A:newProc,startLocked
remote/relay.go [Core]: F:Loopback HTTP forwarder relay for agent API calls | A:relayUpstream,startRelay | S:Loopback HTTP proxy intercepting agent API calls [T:TestRelayForwardsAndStreams]
remote/shellenv.go [Infra]: F:Login shell environment capture and cache | A:captureLoginEnv
remote/shim.go [Edge]: F:Host reverse CLI shim proxying commands to gateway | A:runShim
